    "It will disappear from the panel, notifications, Navigate mode, and Stream Deck. This does not stop or delete the underlying session; cctop will keep it available for lifecycle and Cleanup. You cannot show it again while its local session record exists." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它会从面板、通知、导航模式和 Stream Deck 中消失。这不会停止或删除会话本身；cctop 仍会保留它，用于生命周期判断和清理。只要它的本地会话记录还在，就无法重新显示。"
